sequenceDiagram
    participant U as You
    participant A as Agent
    participant L as LangGraph + checkpointer
    participant H as Human
    U->>A: "Email alice@example.com..."
    A->>L: tool_call send_email(...)
    L->>L: interrupt_on matched — pause and persist
    L-->>U: result["__interrupt__"] with action_requests
    U->>H: show name + args
    H-->>U: approve / reject / edit / respond
    U->>L: Command(resume={"decisions": [...]})
    L-->>A: resume execution
    A-->>U: final answer
